ering in src/core/output/output.ts). Output that cannot fit returns the bounded native output_budget_exceeded refusal with exit 2, and a refusal is never rendered through an override. A renderer's nested SDK contract calls measure their own representation. A custom rendering whose receipts understate it, which happens when the renderer depends on its own receipts, is re-measured and rendered natively, so no unmeasured byte is delivered. Undeclared commands and --output-budget unbounded keep unbounded custom rendering."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Unit and integration specs (TOON and JSON renderer overrides, a service string, nested contract renderers, self-referential renderers) assert refusal with exit 2 at 400 and 1 tokens, fitting receipts equal to ceil(delivered bytes / 4), unbounded expansion kept, and negative controls that fail without each fix"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/close_reason","value":"Custom renderers and output_format services answer to --output-budget over the bytes they deliver"}],"before_hash":"dbdae388dbd7f45a096c6ad2c28d65d09e16da5d67017dfb6c6c24d64373df5c","after_hash":"37557eaa46117e177dffceadaf0bda05733ffe97ae9ba209f4e8f01c4122b662","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"completion":{"timestamp":"2026-11-07T04:18:07.512Z","source":"close_time"},"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"7671076a6440a11d5c14248391e22c534697e4aec868af4f677456199913b016"}
